696 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Michroma is a modern geometric sans\055serif typeface with a distinctive futuristic character\056 Inspired by the retro\055futurist aesthetics of the 1960s\054 it features wide proportions\054 rounded\055square shapes\054 and clean\054 precise lines\056 Its bold and technological feel makes Michroma a strong choice for logos\054 headlines\054 interfaces\054 posters\054 sci\055fi visuals\054 sports branding\054 and projects that need a confident\054 sleek\054 and slightly space\055age visual tone\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 697 0 R
     /Pg 404 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
