699 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Logo Concept\n\n\nThe PRO MIAMI REALTY logo combines the key ideas \nof the brand\072 real estate\054 new opportunities\054 and the distinctive atmosphere of Miami\056 The open door symbolizes access \nto a new home\054 smart investments\054 and future possibilities\056 \nThe palm tree inside the mark highlights the connection \nto Miami\054 its warm climate\054 coastal lifestyle\054 and premium \nliving experience\056\n\nThe clean geometric style and extended modern typography create a feeling of reliability\054 professionalism\054 and confidence\056 The deep green color is associated with stability\054 growth\054 trust\054 and investment value\056 Overall\054 the logo communicates the idea of a company that opens the door to quality real estate \nand comfortable living in Miami\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 700 0 R
     /Pg 528 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

